# xp_wellys_vfr_atc

C++17 X-Plane 12 VFR-ATC plugin (macOS Universal + Windows). German NfL DACH-VFR + English ICAO-VFR. No IFR.

- Language switch: `settings::atc_language()` `"de"`|`"en"` → profile `DE`|`EN` → `data/atc_profiles/{de,en}/`
- Backends (runtime): `local` | `openai` | `mistral` — mode only in `backends/loader.cpp`
- Full detail: `CLAUDE.md`. Short brief: `AGENTS.md`

## Do not break

- Engine uses only `i_speech_to_text` / `i_language_model` / `i_text_to_speech`
- Never branch on `settings::backend_mode()` outside `loader.cpp`
- `xp_atc_engine` stays SDK-free (no `<XPLM*.h>`)
- X-Plane API on main thread only; heavy work on worker threads
- No API keys in `settings.json`; Keychain only; log last 4 chars
- Keep legacy IDs: `com.xp_wellys_devfr_atc.*`, `ch.thWelly.wellys_devfr_atc`, `xp_wellys_devfr_atc/*` commands/prefs

## Workflow

Prefer `make setup|build|test|all|repl|sanitize`. Do not invent abstractions beyond existing style.
